---
source: crates/rustman-cli/src/tests.rs
expression: help
---
Manage this workspace's local CA, used to decrypt intercepted hosts

Usage: rustman record ca [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  init       Create this workspace's local CA (key in the OS keychain, certificate in the user config directory); it is not trusted until `ca install`
  export     Print the CA certificate (PEM, never the key) and its fingerprint
  install    Trust the CA in this machine's trust store, after confirmation
  uninstall  Remove the CA from every trust store Rustman installed it in
  rotate     Replace the CA: uninstall and delete the old one, create a new one
  remove     Delete the CA: uninstall it, then delete its key from the keychain and its certificate
  help       Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --color <WHEN>
          Color: auto (a terminal without NO_COLOR or TERM=dumb), always or never
          
          [default: auto]

  -v, --verbose...
          Log more on stderr: -v requests, -vv headers, -vvv everything (RUST_LOG, when set, replaces these levels)

  -h, --help
          Print help
